WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:04.915
This video shows how to record a new admission enquiry on a phone.

00:00:06.598 --> 00:00:20.134
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Admissions and choose Enquiries. Then tap New Enquiry. The form has three parts: Child and family, Contact and grade, and Tracking.

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:40.999
Type the student name, Ayesha Tariq, and the father name, Tariq Mehmood. Both are marked with a red star because they are required.

00:00:47.317 --> 00:00:54.301
Type the mobile number, which is also required. Then open Grade Applied For and choose Class 1.

00:01:02.469 --> 00:01:09.645
Source says Walk-in. Change it to Phone Call, and add a note, here that they want a morning section.

00:01:20.011 --> 00:01:28.219
Scroll down and tap Create Enquiry. The list opens with a new card for Ayesha Tariq, and its status is New.

00:01:38.356 --> 00:01:43.132
The enquiry is saved and counted in the funnel, ready to be followed up.
